+/**
+ * djmix16 regression: the three vc57 device residuals.
+ *
+ * Bug 1: Never Let Go -> S.A.D (seq90..96) — pinned catch-up moving
+ * carrot (fadeSec 4.59 -> 3.99 -> 2.26 -> 1.2, 0 mix.fire/arm/exit)
